OL,3,GNEWSACharity takes in 110 cats from
OL,4,Asingle property
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity is hoping to find new homes
OL,7,Ffor 110 cats which have been handed
OL,8,Fover from a single property.
OL,10,FHector's House in Torquay, Devon,
OL,11,Festimated it would cost more than
OL,12,F#15,000 to neuter, microchip and
OL,13,Fde-flea and worm the cats.
OL,15,FThe RSPCA has been supporting the team
OL,16,Falongside a number of other animal
OL,17,Fcharities and members of the public.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
