OL,3,GNEWSACharity takes in 110 cats from
OL,4,Asingle property
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was the largest group of cats which
OL,7,Fhad been surrendered to Hector's House
OL,8,Fin one go and centre manager Kim Lott
OL,9,Fsaid the former owner had taken the
OL,10,Fcorrect action by bringing the litter
OL,11,Fto the charity.
